Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.19,0:01:36.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝尔法斯特）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:29.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（荷马史诗）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:37.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（身份确认 伊森·亨特）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:03.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（柏林）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:24.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（机密）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.35,0:17:10.42,Title,0,0,0,0,,《碟中谍6：全面瓦解》
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:28.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（德国 拉姆施泰因空军基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.13,0:31:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害羞嘛 人多更好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.65,0:31:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门嘛 我们没有恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.82,0:31:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能加入你们吗 - 我们不会咬人的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.76,0:34:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也想试试吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.94,0:57:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正从巴黎圣母院前往圣路易斯大桥
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.70,0:57:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,各小队正在追捕
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.70,1:01:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.37,1:01:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在原地
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.68,1:01:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不许动
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.24,1:01:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.55,1:01:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快离开 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.60,1:01:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人 都举起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.44,1:02:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请离开
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.58,1:02:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.13,1:02:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.33,1:02:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要怎么处理她
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.84,1:02:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,了结掉她
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.23,1:02:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.52,1:03:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.26,1:17:09.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（定位来电）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.34,1:43:40.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克什米尔）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.15,1:51:21.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（正在扫描…）
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.41,1:51:32.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（已连接）
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.48,2:00:58.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（小心X射线辐射）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.87,0:00:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 伊森 愿意娶茱莉亚为你的合法妻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, Ethan, take Julia to be your lawful wedded wife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,相依相偎 相亲相爱 相敬相护\N{\fnArial\fs30}To have, to hold, to love, cherish, honor, and protect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.18,0:00:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,去保护她免受已知和未知的恐怖侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}To shield from terrors known and unknown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去撒谎 去欺骗… - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To lie, to deceive… - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,去过双面生活 无法阻止她被绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}To live a double life, to fail to prevent her abduction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹去她的身份 逼她隐于人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}erase her identity, force her into hiding, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.89,0:01:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夺走她所知的一切 - 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- take away all she has known… - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 用自私 徒劳 暂时的方式 - 停\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In a selfish, futile, fleeting attempt… - Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来逃避你真正的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To escape your own true self?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.09,0:01:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚 你选择接受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Julia, do you choose to accept?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.86,0:01:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.29,0:01:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.91,0:01:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该杀了我的 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have killed me, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运对勇士低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fate whispers to the warrior…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,风暴将至\N{\fnArial\fs30}A storm is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇士低声回应\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the warrior whispers back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我即风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.21,0:02:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, Mr. Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.94,0:02:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,无政府主义者所罗门·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anarchist Solomon Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.27,0:02:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从你两年前抓捕他之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you captured him 2 years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的消失带来了意料之外的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}his absence from the world stage has had unintended consequences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.30,0:02:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾领导的由变节特工组成的辛迪加组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}His Syndicate of rogue covert operatives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续在全球范围内肆虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}continues to wreak havoc around the globe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.97,0:02:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局特别行动科\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA's Special Activities Division{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:03:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在坚持不懈地追捕莱恩的特工网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}has relentlessly hunted Lane's elite network of hostiles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.15,0:03:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是有很多人未知或在逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}But many remain unknown and at large.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个极端分裂组织剩余的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remnants of this extremist splinter cell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,自称「使徒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}refer to themselves as "The Apostles."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.65,0:03:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们采取了「雇佣恐袭」策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have since adopted a policy of terror-for-hire, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们成为了更大的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}making them an even greater threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近在印控克什米尔和中巴边界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are responsible for the recent smallpox outbreak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆发的天花疫情\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Indian-controlled Kashmir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.68,0:03:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他们的手笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}along the borders of China and Pakistan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球三分之一的人口都受到了威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}threatening one-third of the world's population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.49,0:03:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,疫情已经得到了控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The epidemic is being contained, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但情报显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}but intelligence would indicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有一个新客户雇佣了使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a new client has hired the Apostles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来执行更庞大的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a more ambitious operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.55,0:03:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人曾联系过他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have been contacted by this man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个信息不详的极端分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}an unidentified extremist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知其代号是「约翰·拉克」\N{\fnArial\fs30}known only by the code name John Lark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.28,0:03:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他撰写了这份末日宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}author of this apocalyptic manifesto{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.38,0:03:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吁人们摧毁当前的世界秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}calling for the destruction of the current world order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,据推测挪威核武器专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is believed Lark is responsible for the disappearance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.56,0:03:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔斯·德布朗克的失踪就与拉克有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}of Norwegian nuclear weapons specialist Nils Delbruuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.05,0:03:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,德布朗克博士的安全权限\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Delbruuk's security clearance was revoked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他发表了极度反宗教言论后就被取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after he expressed fiercely anti-religious views.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,与此同时 使徒一直和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, the Apostles have been in contact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,东欧地下世界的成员有联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}with elements of the Eastern European underworld, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.54,0:03:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们手中有三枚从俄罗斯东部\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are in possession of three plutonium cores{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个导弹基地偷取的三颗钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}stolen from a missile base in eastern Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.41,0:04:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着约翰·拉克和使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would indicate that John Lark and the Apostles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.06,0:04:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在协作 试图获得可用的核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}are working together to acquire functioning nuclear weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,核事件应急支援小组预计 以德布朗克的水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}NEST estimates that a man with Delbruuk's knowledge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用获得的材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}using the materials in play, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以在七十二个小时内造出三枚核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}could complete three nuclear weapons in as little as 72 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些装置将是手提式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These devices would be man-portable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.06,0:04:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一夜之间就能被安放到世界的任意角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deployable anywhere on Earth overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.35,0:04:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些武器在约翰·拉克和使徒手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hands of John Lark and the Apostles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,将对数以百万计的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}these weapons represent an unprecedented threat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,造成前所未有的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}to countless millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.16,0:04:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务 若你选择接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mission, should you choose to accept it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是阻止使徒拿到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to prevent the Apostles from acquiring plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不择一切手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}using any means at your disposal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你或任何你的IMF组员被捕或被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you or any members of your IMF team are caught or killed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长都会否认对你们的行动知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Secretary will disavow any knowledge of your actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,本条信息将在五秒后自毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self-destruct in five seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来不迟到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.25,0:05:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.50,0:05:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉很不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙身上有什么东西让我不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about this guy just really gives me the creeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.68,0:05:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm relaxed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来不像是放松的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't sound relaxed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 他听起来放松吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, does he sound relaxed to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.29,0:05:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他听起来害怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounds terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 我没有害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I'm not terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.05,0:05:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是有种不祥的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have a bad feeling is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚不是说你很放松吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you were relaxed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松的同时又极度不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's entirely possible to be relaxed and extremely uneasy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是完全有可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the same time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不可能 - 你就总这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's not. - You do it all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 - 你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I don't. - Yes, you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让我相信你现在完全放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to believe that you are perfectly relaxed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此时此地… - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- right here, now… - Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一条黑暗的小巷里 等着从一个变态手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a dark alleyway, waiting to buy black-market plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.45,0:05:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买黑市钚核 - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from a psychopath. - Benji, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.61,0:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让你出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let anything happen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 瞧吧 班吉 你非常安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - See, Benji, you're perfectly safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.23,0:05:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得轻松 你可是坐在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy for you to say, you're in the van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你想出外勤的 「硬汉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wanted to be in the field, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚 路德 我想待在车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And tonight, Luther, I would like to be in the van!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好钱 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have that money ready, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你能收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.67,0:06:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.68,0:06:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底还做不做交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we finally gonna do this or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能在这行生存下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have survived in this business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.85,0:06:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,全靠我脑海中的一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the help of a voice in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.05,0:06:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个声音从来不出错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This voice is never wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.76,0:06:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而无论我何时遇到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whenever I meet you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它总会跟我说同一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}it tells me the same thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.69,0:06:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.72,0:06:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来做生意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to do business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你的声音扔硬币决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the voice to flip a coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.51,0:07:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是根铍棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a beryllium rod, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,它引发里面的钚产生了反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is causing a reaction with the plutonium inside the core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.58,0:07:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.32,0:08:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钱拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 把钱拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, bring the money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要那笔钱 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need that money, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 你能收到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 快回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德现在不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther's not here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,使徒能为你做什么 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can the Apostles do for you, Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被包围了 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're boxed in, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钚给我们 然后离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the plutonium and walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.65,0:09:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 把车开过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, get the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 把车开过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, get the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟你做个交易 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make you a deal, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把钚给我们 我们就不杀你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the plutonium and we won't kill your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 伊森 别为了我这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you do it, Ethan! Not for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna count to three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 二 - 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two. - Luther…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - Three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不知道还能怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I didn't know what else to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会放在心上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.46,0:10:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本该已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本该都该已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should all be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,钚核呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the plutonium?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.03,0:10:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果您刚刚打开电视\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're just joining us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,三起大爆炸事件同时发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}three massive explosions have gone off simultaneously{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.79,0:10:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前看来是联合恐怖袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}in what appears to be a coordinated attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.53,0:10:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从罗马拍摄到的梵蒂冈的实时画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}This image is live in Rome, looking toward the Vatican{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这是我们的镜头能到达的最近距离了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is as close as our cameras can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,据消息称 爆炸发生时\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is believed that the Pope was in residence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.43,0:11:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,教皇正位于他的居所内\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the time of the blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从耶路撒冷城外拍摄到的城内的实时画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also live, we're looking at Jerusalem from just outside the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是圣城麦加的实时画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also live, the holy city of Mecca{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是停靠在沙特阿拉伯附近的红海上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the USS Ronald Reagan in the Red Sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,里根号航空母舰拍摄到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}off the coast of Saudi Arabia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经探测到了核辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation has been detected, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着这些令人震惊的袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}indicating that nuclear weapons were used{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.44,0:11:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用了核武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}in these unspeakable attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.28,0:11:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 时间到了 - 目前虽没有具体伤亡数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan, it's time. - No word on casualties yet, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以预计\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can assume{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.71,0:11:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡人数将是灾难级的\N{\fnArial\fs30}the death toll is catastrophic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,初期报告显示 制造袭击中使用的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Early reports suggest the weapons used{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要极其专业的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}would require highly specialized knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而只有极少数人具备这样的知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}that very few people possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的问题是 谁会同时袭击这三座宗教圣城\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question now is who would attack all three of these holy sites?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,三起袭击精确地发生在同一时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attacks occurred at precisely the same moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.05,0:11:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在一个多小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}just over an hour ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.51,0:11:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,东部时间凌晨四点\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 4:00 a.m. Eastern Time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.27,0:11:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸发生几分钟内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within minutes of the attack, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会紧急休会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congress ordered an emergency recess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.20,0:11:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,国会大厦被疏散\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Capitol Building was evacuated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.28,0:11:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统乘坐空军一号离开了华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The President left Washington on Air Force One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.98,0:12:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,白宫宣布进入紧急状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White House has declared a state of emergency, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.45,0:12:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令军队处于最高戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}placing the military on highest alert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们单独待会儿吗 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you excuse us, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.63,0:12:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,德布朗克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Delbruuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.28,0:12:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看了宣言 也找到了你的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We read the manifesto, we found your lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.67,0:12:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,「所有的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There has never been peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.04,0:12:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,都需要伟大的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}without first a great suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.96,0:12:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲越大 和平越久「\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greater the suffering, the greater the peace."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这能让他们团结起来 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, this will unite them. Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们读到这份宣言的时候就会懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When they read this manifesto, they'll all understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都不会有人读到这份宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's gonna read that manifesto, ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can promise you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是几号\N{\fnArial\fs30}What day is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.89,0:12:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have I been here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一件事是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the last thing you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was driving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人撞了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone hit me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.71,0:12:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是两周前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was two weeks ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两周 - 两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two weeks? - Two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is yours, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克就是用这个跟你联系的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how Lark communicated with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.29,0:13:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拉克 - 约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lark? - John Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.19,0:13:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们知道关于他的一切 - 你们什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We know all about him. - You know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手机上有线索能帮我们找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's information in this phone that could lead us to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你知道密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have the passcode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们觉得拉克是敌人 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Lark is the enemy, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.72,0:13:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你们是谁 你们才是敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, whoever you are, you are the enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.85,0:13:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们才是这个体制得以苟存的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're why the system survives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 劫难不断持续的原因 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why the suffering goes on. - Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.61,0:13:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在乎你 我们只想抓到拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't care about you. We want Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.38,0:13:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做个交易如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we make a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没有交易 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, there's no deal, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.35,0:13:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step outside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.35,0:13:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我和这家伙待五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me five minutes with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.39,0:13:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我不能让你这么做 我们不是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I can't let you do that. That's not who we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.76,0:13:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们该重新考虑这一点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then maybe we need to reconsider that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.49,0:13:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们在电视上宣读这份宣言呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if they read the manifesto on the air?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你能做到这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You can do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打个电话就能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it with a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他宣读了拉克的宣言…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if he reads Lark's manifesto…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就把密码给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you the passcode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan! Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了大局着想 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of the greater good, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 只要你们这么做就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他不愿意合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he won't cooperate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.97,0:14:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们宣读那份宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we read the manifesto{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在直播中读\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:24.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,贸易以及全球市场大幅下跌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trading and global markets plummeted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.63,0:14:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我刚收到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. I'm told{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.26,0:14:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一些额外的消息要报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're about to get some additional information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚拿到了一份来自尼尔斯·德布朗克的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just been handed a document from Nils Delbruuk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一位核武器专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nuclear weapons specialist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.30,0:14:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,并声称自己是袭击中所使用的武器的制造者\N{\fnArial\fs30}who claims to have built the weapons used in these attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.95,0:14:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被要求完整朗读这份宣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been asked to read this manifesto in its entirety.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「所有的和平 都需要伟大的牺牲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There has never been peace without first a great suffering."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.83,0:15:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「牺牲越大 和平越久」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The greater the suffering, the greater the peace."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人类正在走上自毁之途」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"As mankind is drawn to his self-destruction"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「犹如飞蛾扑火般」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"like a moth to the candle, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那些所谓的和平捍卫者」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the so-called defenders of peace, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,「教会 政府 法律」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the church, the government, the law, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.54,0:15:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,「孜孜不倦地阻止人类自毁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"work tirelessly to save humanity from itself."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你们要这些也没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna help you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「但为了避免灾难」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But by averting disaster, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他们选择推迟…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"they serve to delay a peace…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,木已成舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.78,0:15:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「只有经过火的洗礼才能最终诞生的和平」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"that can only come through an inevitable baptism of fire."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.09,0:15:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我带给你们的灾难不是末日的开始」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The suffering I bring you is not the beginning of the end."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.64,0:15:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「而是一个更好的 互相理解的世界的开始」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It is the beginning of a greater mutual understanding…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.56,0:15:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「这是迈向人类终极团结的第一步」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It is the first step toward the ultimate brotherhood of man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.65,0:15:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我带给你们的灾难」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The suffering I bring you"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.43,0:15:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「是通往终极和平的桥梁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"is the bridge to ultimate peace."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.84,0:15:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:15:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.07,0:16:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说我们会拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we'd get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.51,0:16:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.06,0:16:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击还没发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attacks didn't happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.11,0:16:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在一小时之前出的车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car accident you were in, that was an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞你的那辆车就是我开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was driving the other car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,木是不是已经成了舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.32,0:16:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那得我们说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we say it's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.71,0:17:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.44,0:17:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你解锁的那个手机 让我们找到了一个冰岛的服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}That phone you unlocked led us to a server in Iceland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功解码了一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we managed to decrypt a communique{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.09,0:17:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·拉克和这个女人之间的公报\N{\fnArial\fs30}between John Lark and this woman:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.70,0:17:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉娜·米索普利斯 活动家以及慈善家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alana Mitsopolis, activist and philanthropist, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她进行的慈善活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose charity work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.46,0:17:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她得到了白寡妇的绰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}has earned her the nickname the White Widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.07,0:17:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是为了掩护她真正的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all a front for her real trade:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.80,0:17:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器贸易 洗钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arms dealing, money laundering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.68,0:17:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,广泛的政府关系也为她提供了保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extensive political connections provide her with protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克和寡妇今晚要碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lark and the Widow are meeting tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来协商关于某个未知包裹的交付问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}to negotiate delivery of an unspecified package, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能假设这个包裹是我们丢失的钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we can only assume is our missing plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会在巴黎大皇宫的私人会所碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll make contact in a private lounge at the Grand Palais in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.06,0:18:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会在那里举办她的年度筹款活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}during her annual fundraising event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,细节全在文件里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The details are in the file.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果拉克在午夜十二点还没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lark isn't there by midnight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇就会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Widow will leave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.95,0:18:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且把包裹出售给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sell the package to the highest bidder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还剩两小时来找到拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which gives you two hours from now to find Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 我想有些事情你需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I think there's something you need to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.85,0:18:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我… - 我必须马上打断你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… - I'm gonna stop you right there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.63,0:18:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在柏林时面临的是艰难的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a terrible choice to make in Berlin:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保住钚核还是去救你的队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Recover the plutonium or save your team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择了队员 现在整个世界都陷入了危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose your team, and now the world is at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自身本质的某些缺陷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some flaw deep in your core being{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.16,0:18:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你无法在一条命和数百万条生命之间抉择\N{\fnArial\fs30}simply won't allow you to choose between one life and millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.77,0:18:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这是你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that as a sign of weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.40,0:18:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对我而言 这正是你最强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}To me, that's your greatest strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.99,0:18:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也说明有朝一日我可以指望你来救我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It also tells me I can count on you to cover my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.01,0:18:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为虽然从中情局调来这里是平级调动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because coming over here from the CIA was a lateral move, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.21,0:18:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有人说是降职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some say a step down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.24,0:18:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是到这里来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.06,0:18:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.25,0:18:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me regret it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.92,0:19:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把飞机停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut 'em down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在干什么 艾瑞卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing, Erika?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.40,0:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个任务可能是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be your mission, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这架飞机是中情局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is the CIA's plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.05,0:19:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没我的允许 它就不能起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't take off without my say-so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间跟你争\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have time for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.10,0:19:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在巴黎的小队已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a team in Paris ready to grab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.91,0:19:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克一离开大楼我们就会抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lark as soon as he leaves the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.71,0:19:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架G5飞机会把他引渡到关塔那摩监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}A G5 standing by to rendition him to Gitmo, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在那里拷问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}where a waterboard is waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,花上无谓的二十四小时来问出一份我们无法相信的口供\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spend 24 hours we don't have to pull a confession we can't trust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,供述者还连身份都不能确定 我不认同这方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a man we haven't positively identified? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要可靠的情报 现在就要\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need reliable intelligence, and we need it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF的存在就是为了处理这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}This scenario is precisely why the IMF exists!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.38,0:19:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF就是万圣节闹剧 艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The IMF is Halloween, Alan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群成年人戴着面具在玩不给糖就捣蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bunch of grown men in rubber masks playing trick-or-treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他在柏林时能保住钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he had held on to the plutonium in Berlin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.11,0:20:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不用在这里争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wouldn't be having this conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样他的队员就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his team would be dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.73,0:20:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实 他们会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. They would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是职责所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.35,0:20:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此我才希望现场有一个我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why I want one of my own men on the scene{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.54,0:20:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,来评估情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}to appraise the situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.07,0:20:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克特工 来自特别行动组\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Walker, Special Activities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名声我早有耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}His reputation precedes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你习惯用手术刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You use a scalpel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢用锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer a hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer is no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.85,0:20:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有直接来自总统的行动授权\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have operational authority here, direct from the President.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.55,0:20:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是有异议 就自己去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a problem with that, you take it up with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.07,0:20:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经找过了 他也同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have already, and he agrees with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.87,0:20:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我的人跟着去 要么谁都别想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man goes or no one goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.05,0:20:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能让任何人阻止你拿到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one comes between you and that plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特不能 他的队员不能 任何人都不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Hunt, not his team, not anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇在政府各层都有眼线\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White Widow has spies at every level of government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架飞机伪装成了商用客机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This plane is posing as a commercial airliner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.58,0:21:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就能跳伞进入法国境内而不被发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can jump into France undetected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和拉克会于午夜十二点在贵宾厅见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Widow's meeting Lark in the VIP lounge at midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有预先发放的电子手环 任何人都不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will be admitted without a pre-issued electronic I.D. band.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经拿到了拉克手环上的射频识别码\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have acquired the unique RFID number for Lark's band, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.28,0:21:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就可以定位他\N{\fnArial\fs30}allowing us to locate it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.33,0:21:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,用这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.87,0:21:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到那个手环\N{\fnArial\fs30}you find Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.60,0:21:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就找到了拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}you find Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.11,0:21:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.33,0:21:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.01,0:21:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我借用他的身份来与白寡妇联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume his identity and make contact with the Widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她领着我们找到包裹\N{\fnArial\fs30}She takes us to the package.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.00,0:21:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的有人信你这烂招吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}People actually fall for this shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.35,0:21:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备怎么让拉克合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you intend to make Lark cooperate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在人群中撞他一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bump him in the crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出十秒 他就会跟派对上的其他醉汉一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}In ten seconds he'll look like any other drunk at the party, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,语无伦次 毫无还手之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}incoherent and completely pliable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我装成他的样子之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I borrow his face, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.21,0:21:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就带他走出前门\N{\fnArial\fs30}you walk him out the front door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:21:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他交给斯隆的撤离小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hand him to Sloane's extraction team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.25,0:22:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别想这么轻易就甩掉我 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not getting rid of me that easily, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.20,0:22:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这么做不是为了甩掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what this is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.83,0:22:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不想让我插手这次的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you don't want me on this detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.56,0:22:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是面对现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's face it:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.19,0:22:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在柏林能狠一狠心\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd made the hard choice in Berlin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不会在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.70,0:22:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有击毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you hadn't gunned down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们派你去追查的每一个辛迪加特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}every Syndicate agent they sent you to find, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不用出现在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.38,0:22:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道关于你的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I know all about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.40,0:22:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为你 我们才没有活着的证人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're why we don't have a living witness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,能来指认约翰·拉克或者使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}who can identify John Lark or the Apostles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.13,0:22:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你对我的方法有意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have a problem with my methods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以一直留在后方\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can always stay behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你的任务 由你来决定是否接受」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your mission, should you choose to accept it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.54,0:22:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这么说的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.75,0:22:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟之后开始减压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes to decompression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.85,0:22:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇半小时后就要跟拉克会面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Widow is meeting Lark in 30 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.84,0:23:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒钟之后开始减压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds to decompression.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.53,0:23:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的氧气开了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is your oxygen on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个海拔高度大气稀薄\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no atmosphere at this altitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.16,0:23:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不希望你晕过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need you blacking out on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.54,0:23:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你头盔上的屏幕有内置的导航系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your heads-up display has a built-in guidance system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.79,0:23:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着它降落到目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow it to the target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统告诉你开伞时你再开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your chute when the system says, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.92,0:23:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许早也不许晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}not before and definitely not after, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.84,0:23:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则最后经过你大脑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the last thing that goes through your mind{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.48,0:23:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你的膝盖骨 明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be your kneecaps. Is that clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.29,0:23:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crystal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.96,0:23:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要谈谈 需要重新制定计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to talk. We need to rethink this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.84,0:23:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别挡路 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.06,0:23:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克 现在有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker, we've got a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.16,0:23:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}外面风暴肆虐 我们需要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a storm. We need to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.25,0:23:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}巴黎见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.67,0:24:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海拔 两万五千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude: 25, 000 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter, Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.14,0:24:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点闪电就让你怕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You afraid of a little lightning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.79,0:24:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海拔 两万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude: 20, 000 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.19,0:24:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.77,0:24:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听得到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.91,0:25:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.55,0:25:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.36,0:25:11.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海拔 一万五千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude: 15, 000 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.53,0:25:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.77,0:25:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.96,0:25:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.25,0:25:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}海拔 一万英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Altitude: 10, 000 feet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.43,0:25:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}九千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}9, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.60,0:25:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}八千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}8, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.55,0:25:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}七千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}7, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.42,0:25:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}6, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.15,0:25:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}5, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.69,0:26:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}4, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.91,0:26:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.48,0:26:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.39,0:26:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三千英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}3, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.57,0:26:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开伞 开伞 开伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy. Deploy. Deploy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开伞 开伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deploy. Deploy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.59,0:26:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你氧气断了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you lost your oxygen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.40,0:27:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白寡妇和拉克就在那里碰头\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where the Widow is meeting Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.17,0:28:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.70,0:28:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沃克 - 伊森 如果你能听见我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walker. - Ethan, if you can hear me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.80,0:28:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一遍 哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say again. Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.30,0:28:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他朝洗手间去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's headed for the bathroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.04,0:30:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 针剂在哪 - 不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the needle? - Didn't need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.47,0:30:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他抬起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.71,0:33:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还能做面具吗 - 我至少得有张脸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you still make a mask? - I need a face to make a mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.54,0:33:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.92,0:33:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来瞄准的是他的胸口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was aiming for his chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.36,0:33:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.59,0:33:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我糊涂了 你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm confused. You are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.05,0:33:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}An old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,取消撤离小队 目标已死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cancel extraction. We're code blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.45,0:33:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,派清理人员来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send sanitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.87,0:33:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,北侧男洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}North men's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.84,0:34:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有回答我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't answer my question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.48,0:34:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.32,0:34:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样 放轻松 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Just take it easy. That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.49,0:34:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持抬头的姿势直到停止出血为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep your head back until the bleeding stops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.44,0:34:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? Eh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.60,0:34:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里不是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not here by accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.32,0:34:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.29,0:34:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.49,0:34:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.53,0:34:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和那个白寡妇有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a date with the White Widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.84,0:34:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他和那个寡妇有个约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a date with the Widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你长得一点也不像他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look nothing like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.85,0:34:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们只能希望他们从未见过面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we have to hope they never met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.12,0:34:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望可不是什么策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope is not a strategy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.80,0:34:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you must be new.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no other choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇是我们唯一的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White Widow's our only lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.04,0:34:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须假扮成这家伙五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to be this guy for five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.78,0:34:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这么做 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.00,0:34:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 你向我隐瞒了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What aren't you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.76,0:34:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不清楚你被卷入了什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand what you're involved in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.18,0:34:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚我被卷入了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what I'm involved in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.34,0:34:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不清楚我被卷入了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what I'm involved in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.08,0:34:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底被卷入了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I involved in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.16,0:34:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要和寡妇见面 她三分钟后就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're meeting the Widow, she leaves in three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.02,0:34:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 我会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan! - I'll make it work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.75,0:34:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 我会搞定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan! - I'll make it work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.02,0:35:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.26,0:35:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.45,0:35:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.76,0:35:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.83,0:35:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我和你一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going with you. - Like hell you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.56,0:35:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一些人被派来杀拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}People have been sent here to kill Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.21,0:35:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.90,0:35:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是我 是那些合约杀手和雇佣杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not me. Contractors. Paid assassins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.56,0:35:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不知道他长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know what he looks like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.81,0:35:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只知道他半夜要和寡妇见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}they only know he's meeting the Widow at midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you go through with this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.84,0:35:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会认为你就是拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna believe you're Lark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.88,0:35:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're gonna kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.43,0:35:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.36,0:35:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't tell you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.48,0:35:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该彻底金盆洗手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've stayed out of the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.60,0:35:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当初应该跟我一起走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.83,0:36:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场慈善晚会是为了纪念我的母亲而举办的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This charity was started in honor of my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.08,0:36:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们中认识她的人都了解她的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those of you who knew her understood her strength, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.24,0:36:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的坚韧 她的足智多谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}her tenacity, her resourcefulness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.13,0:36:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她还有着另外一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there was another side to her, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.69,0:36:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数人从未见过的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}a side most people never saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.32,0:36:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是她精神中的那一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is that part of her spirit that has brought us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.84,0:36:19.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们今晚齐聚一堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}all together tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.34,0:36:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克丝有点自相矛盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max was something of a paradox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对矛盾非常着迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a fascination for paradoxes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这种情感传承到了我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}a fascination she passed on to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.61,0:36:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克丝看透了我们现在生活的这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max had no illusions about the world we live in today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她梦想着能有一个截然不同的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she had dreams of a very different future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.44,0:36:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不再需要她独特才能的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}One in which her unique talents were no longer required.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.85,0:36:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从这个世界的方式中所获得的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she earned from the way the world is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.84,0:36:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终都是为了让它成为将来可能成为的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}went ultimately to making it what it could someday be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.98,0:36:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的未来还没有到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That future isn't here yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.73,0:36:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而今晚 你们的慷慨捐赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, your contributions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.79,0:37:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们离那个世界更近了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}have brought it just a little closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.09,0:37:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢大家的光临\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all for coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请享受这场盛宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.82,0:37:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能是约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't possibly be John Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.56,0:37:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.49,0:37:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是个化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an alias.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.44,0:37:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许它至少比无名氏要好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it's better than John Doe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.71,0:37:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有什么别的名字吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there another name you prefer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.29,0:37:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么地方我们可以私下谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there somewhere we could talk privately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.72,0:37:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实挺喜欢「拉克」这名字 有种独特的魅力\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact I like "Lark." It does have a certain ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.32,0:37:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.44,0:37:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'll be honest with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.45,0:37:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你在外的名声来看 我没想到你会这么帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of your reputation, I was expecting someone uglier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.07,0:38:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要被外表所欺 我的真面目也很凶恶丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let looks deceive. I'm as ugly as they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.96,0:38:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说句实话 你的生命处于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll be honest with you. Your life is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.06,0:38:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不准碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you touch her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.29,0:38:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 这是我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.47,0:38:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我们的客人很粗鲁 佐拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being rude to our guest, Zola.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.72,0:38:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.31,0:38:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在这儿闹得很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn this into a scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.36,0:38:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想和这个人待在一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to be with this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.46,0:38:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.79,0:38:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生命处于危险之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your life is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.08,0:38:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who would want to kill me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.61,0:38:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans, for starters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.28,0:38:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是这样 那我早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that were true, I would know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你是唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.79,0:38:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在政府内部有间谍的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with spies in the government?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.99,0:38:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有人不希望我跟你见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people here who don't want this meeting to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.97,0:38:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't believe me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.11,0:38:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.56,0:38:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're thinking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们不是来杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're not here for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.62,0:39:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们的目标是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're just here for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.02,0:39:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意冒这个险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you willing to take that chance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.00,0:39:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有我想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have something I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.25,0:39:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这让我成为你唯一可以信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, that makes me the only person you can trust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.56,0:39:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你活着离开这里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get you out of here alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.87,0:39:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你更愿意依靠你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or would you rather leave that to your brother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.48,0:39:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想马上回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'd like to go home now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.58,0:39:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.98,0:41:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国政府今天中午已经收到了「货」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The French government took receipt of the asset at noon today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.26,0:41:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将在明天早上八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivery will be via air to the Finance Ministry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.43,0:41:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,空运至财政部\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 8:00 a.m. tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.21,0:41:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一支在警方严密护送下的装甲车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}An armored motorcade under heavy police escort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.99,0:41:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,将通过这条路线运送他\N{\fnArial\fs30}will transport him via this route.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.44,0:41:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将在这个十字路口制造障碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll create a diversion at this intersection, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.93,0:41:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,车队将会自动行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}The motorcade will automatically take{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.48,0:41:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这条预选的备用路线\N{\fnArial\fs30}the preplanned alternate route here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.28,0:41:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到时候半路截取「货物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we'll extract the asset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.21,0:42:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,截取「货物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extract the asset?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.35,0:42:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是「货物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The asset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.76,0:42:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为了这条消息花了很大一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We paid a great deal of money for this information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们什么都交代清楚了 除了这个人的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave us everything but this man's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.50,0:42:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会碰巧知道他是谁 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't happen to know who he is, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.03,0:42:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫所罗门·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Solomon Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.78,0:42:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是英国特工 叛变成了无政府主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}British Special Agent turned anarchist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.44,0:42:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他利用变节特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used rogue covert operatives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,创建了一个被称为辛迪加的恐怖网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}to create a terror network called the Syndicate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.08,0:42:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处搞破坏 暗杀 大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sabotage, assassination, mass murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.25,0:42:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,极度凶恶丑陋\N{\fnArial\fs30}As ugly as they come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.89,0:42:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,两年前他曾被美国特工抓捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was captured by American agents two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.48,0:42:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后 他一直在被无休止地审讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since then, he's been in a never-ending interrogation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.62,0:42:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一个政府转到另一个政府手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}passed around from one government to another{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.21,0:42:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他的罪行负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}to answer for his crimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.15,0:43:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去不太高兴 拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem displeased, Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.55,0:43:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我没有表达清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I didn't make myself clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.27,0:43:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来巴黎是为了钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to Paris for plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.83,0:43:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其中一定有些误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there must be a misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.58,0:43:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是个中间人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a broker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.57,0:43:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我负责联系买主和卖主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I connect a buyer and a seller.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.15,0:43:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的卖家对现金不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}My seller's not interested in cash, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.10,0:43:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你想要钚核…\N{\fnArial\fs30}so if you want the plutonium…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.86,0:43:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须截获莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Extract Lane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.16,0:43:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后进行交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make a trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.13,0:43:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道卖家有我想要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know the seller has what I want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.55,0:43:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是充满诚意的定金\N{\fnArial\fs30}A down payment in good faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.51,0:43:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,信使会在四十八小时内送来另外两枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}A courier will deliver two more within 48 hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.64,0:43:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来交换他\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.87,0:44:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.60,0:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,改道后会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens after the diversion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.25,0:45:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有人都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill everyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.19,0:45:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.81,0:45:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be no witnesses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.77,0:45:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如何保证莱恩能在行动中活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my guarantee that lane walks out of this thing alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.08,0:45:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在一个装甲箱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in an armored box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.07,0:45:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到安全时 我们才会把他放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pull him out when it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.68,0:46:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要拿到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want your plutonium, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.58,0:46:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.32,0:46:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说你的底线是不能杀警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you draw the line at killing cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.77,0:46:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位可是约翰·拉克啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's John Lark you're talking to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.99,0:46:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用天花谋杀妇女和儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}I murder women and children with smallpox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.52,0:46:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有底线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.57,0:46:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.03,0:46:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好好休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep well, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.68,0:46:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天会很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy day tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.16,0:46:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是在跟我开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have got to be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.46,0:46:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想让莱恩从监狱里出来 就只能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want Lane out of prison, this is how it gets done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.24,0:46:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让拉克把他救出来 不是伊森·亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted Lark to break him out, not Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.17,0:47:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要拉克去交易 不是伊森·亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted Lark at the exchange, not Ethan Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.49,0:47:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要拉克引我们找到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted Lark to lead us to the plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.36,0:47:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,和使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Apostles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.18,0:47:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许仍然有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may still get your chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.83,0:47:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了我们从巴黎大皇宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you forgotten about the corpse we pulled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.66,0:47:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,男厕所拖出来的那具尸体吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of the men's room at the Grand Palais?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.30,0:47:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那并不是拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing that wasn't Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.16,0:47:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有可能是拉克的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}More likely one of Lark's recruits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.52,0:47:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我们的情报显示并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not according to our intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.08,0:47:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,情报是由谁收集的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intelligence gathered by whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.35,0:47:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.44,0:47:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直怀疑拉克是一名美国特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've long held suspicions that Lark was an American agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.94,0:47:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解我们一举一动的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who knew our every move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.65,0:47:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,能像幽灵一样来去无踪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who could come and go like a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.41,0:47:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是说亨特就是约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're suggesting Hunt is John Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.22,0:47:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为了自保不惜抓住任何救命稻草 沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're reaching, Walker. Trying to save your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.55,0:47:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.24,0:47:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.42,0:47:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个像拉克那么小心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would a man as careful as Lark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.60,0:47:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的会冒这样的风险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}really stick his neck out like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.55,0:47:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了和白寡妇面对面交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a face-to-face with the White Widow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.96,0:47:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他会派代理人去 - 一个诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'd send a proxy. - A decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.78,0:47:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他真的足够聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he was really smart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.42,0:47:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让他的女性朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd have his lady friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.88,0:47:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在可靠的证人 也就是我的面前 杀死那个诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}kill that decoy in front of a reliable witness. Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.67,0:48:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉网式搜捕即将围剿他的恐怖主义第二人格\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragnet is closing in on his terrorist alter ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.94,0:48:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他花钱请一个人来扮演拉克的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he pays a man to play the part of Lark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.72,0:48:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has him killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.68,0:48:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,在为国家服务的幌子下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And under the guise of serving his country…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.40,0:48:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装出他自己的秘密身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assumes his own secret identity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.98,0:48:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在美国政府的全力支持下 可以恣意妄为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free to operate at will with the full support of the U.S. government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.48,0:48:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.01,0:48:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特为什么要背叛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Hunt turn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.16,0:48:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩为什么背叛 他的使徒又为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Lane do it? Why did any of his Apostles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.85,0:48:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都曾有着崇高的信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were believers in a cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.88,0:48:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,当那个信仰被证实是谎言的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when that cause turned out to be a lie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.39,0:48:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就背叛了自己的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}they turned against their masters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.13,0:48:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特的政府背叛了他多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times has Hunt's government betrayed him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.48,0:48:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,否认他的存在 把他丢到一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}disavowed him, cast him aside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.60,0:48:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他这样的人 忍到什么时候就忍无可忍了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how long before a man like that has had enough?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.92,0:48:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个严重的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a serious accusation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.17,0:48:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能证实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you prove it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.54,0:48:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们在巴黎大皇宫\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the phone we pulled off the dead body{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.31,0:48:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,从尸体身上找到的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the Grand Palais.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.06,0:49:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜里面会有你需要的所有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm guessing it has all the proof you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩真的曾用毒气毒死了一个有两千人的村庄吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true Lane gassed a village of 2, 000 people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.23,0:51:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.12,0:51:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的曾击落一架客机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true he brought down an entire passenger plane{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.01,0:51:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了杀死一个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to kill one man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.35,0:51:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.62,0:51:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他真的… - 沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it true that he… - Hey, Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.14,0:51:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你听说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you heard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.36,0:51:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要让你觉得毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it makes your skin crawl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.88,0:51:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那很可能就是真的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's probably true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.49,0:51:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.63,0:51:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是抓住他的那个人 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the guy that caught him, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.78,0:51:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他能把这件事隐瞒多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think he's gonna keep that to himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.62,0:51:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候见机行事 阻止他说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll burn that bridge when we get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.10,0:54:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is he doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.87,0:56:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt? Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.68,0:56:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.51,0:56:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? What's wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.40,0:56:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在车库见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you at the garage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.53,0:56:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 你收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.43,0:56:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到 说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We copy. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.71,0:56:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变计划 我暴露了 需要协助脱身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of plan. I'm blown. Need extraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.90,0:56:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.76,1:01:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.26,1:02:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐拉想跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zola wants a word with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.93,1:03:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.89,1:03:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.84,1:03:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说下 我叫沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name's Walker, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.83,1:03:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你选的这么小的车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the little car your idea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.24,1:04:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus Christ!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.16,1:04:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.95,1:04:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都下车 - 快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody out. - Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.45,1:06:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伊尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was Ilsa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.43,1:06:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.21,1:06:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.20,1:07:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴再次见到你 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you again, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.36,1:07:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁还活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look who's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.10,1:07:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的脖子里有个微波追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a microwave tracker in his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.11,1:07:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 你知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. You know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.53,1:07:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 一点都不疼…才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me just assure you, this won't hurt…enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.48,1:07:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有九十秒的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.95,1:07:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和你的使徒以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your Apostles think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.28,1:07:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会用你来换丢失的钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna trade you for the missing plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.76,1:08:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to tell you that's never gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.56,1:08:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你的任务 请选择是否接受」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your mission, should you choose to accept it."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.87,1:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder, Ethan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.74,1:08:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择过不接受吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you ever choose not to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.03,1:08:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有停下来问过自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever stop and ask yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.01,1:08:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你下命令的人是谁或者背后的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who it was giving you the orders or why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.32,1:08:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一天 你侍奉的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}While every day the master you serve{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.15,1:08:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离让世界毁灭都更近了一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}moves one step closer to ending the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.88,1:08:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖分子做出这样的指控还真奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange accusation coming from a terrorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.28,1:08:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sixty seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.16,1:08:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怖分子就像是渴求被关注的学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorists are schoolboys desperate for attention, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.71,1:08:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,寄希望于用恐惧来改变公众的观念\N{\fnArial\fs30}hoping to shape public opinion through fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.32,1:08:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不关心人们会怎么想或是什么感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care in the least what people think or feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.84,1:08:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我的经验 他们很快就会忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my experience, they don't do either for very long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.60,1:08:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就能成为你炸毁工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and I suppose that justifies bombing factories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.56,1:08:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸掉民用飞机的合理理由吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or bringing down civilian aircraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.40,1:08:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者给我绑上炸弹背心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or strapping me into an explosive vest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.93,1:08:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一项还没完成 有趣的小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it unfinished business, my funny little friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.03,1:08:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路德 - 快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Luther? - Almost there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.01,1:08:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我一样看得清结局 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see the end as clearly as I do, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.28,1:08:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界的政府都陷入了疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governments the world over are descending into madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.44,1:08:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,建立辛迪加的目的就是一点一点地摧毁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syndicate was created to tear them down, brick by brick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.28,1:08:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪加是一群只知道杀人的懦夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syndicate was a pack of murdering cowards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.43,1:09:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛迪加是文明最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Syndicate was civilization's last hope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.02,1:09:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个粉碎旧的世界秩序的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance to smash the old world order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.96,1:09:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个希望现在破灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hope is gone now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.24,1:09:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为你和你可悲的道德观\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of you and your pathetic morality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.57,1:09:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该杀了我的 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have killed me, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.07,1:09:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直害怕的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end you've always feared{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.56,1:09:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.32,1:09:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.81,1:09:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的双手将沾满鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the blood will be on your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.98,1:09:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的好意造成的彻底毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fallout of all your good intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.44,1:09:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.45,1:09:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,取出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.14,1:10:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.24,1:10:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're mine now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.73,1:10:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你身上真是充满惊喜 拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just full of surprises, Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.99,1:10:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哥哥的计划从一开始就注定失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's plan was bad from the word go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.71,1:10:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会丧失所有手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd have lost all your men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.71,1:10:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩还会死在交火中\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Lane would've been killed in the crossfire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.24,1:10:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不临时变通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to improvise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.58,1:10:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么不早说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why not say that in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.16,1:10:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不信任你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't trust your people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.96,1:10:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其不信任你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially not your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.88,1:10:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人 能拿他们怎么办呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family. What can you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.88,1:10:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 莱恩在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, where's Lane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.01,1:10:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然不在塞纳河底\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly not at the bottom of the Seine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.27,1:11:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在我手上 很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have him. He's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.83,1:11:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪儿见信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do I meet the courier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.46,1:11:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们谈谈那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk about the woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.08,1:11:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.32,1:11:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在巴黎大皇宫时她也和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was with you at the Palais.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.74,1:11:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,佐拉今天又看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zola saw her again today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.56,1:11:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,她试图杀了莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to kill Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.88,1:11:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有机会杀你 但她没有下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had the chance to kill you, but she didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.90,1:11:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.56,1:11:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有段过往\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.60,1:11:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来很复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.92,1:11:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你把它变得更复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll make it more complicated for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.80,1:11:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚涨价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My price just went up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.98,1:11:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有人杀了我的四个手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone killed four of my men today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.98,1:11:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assuming it was her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.03,1:11:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要她 拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want her, Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.76,1:11:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把她交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna bring her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.75,1:11:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则你就见不到信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, you don't meet the courier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.34,1:11:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,钚核会卖给出价最高者\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the plutonium goes to the highest bidder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.20,1:11:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让她成为我们之间的阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate for her to come between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.73,1:12:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.09,1:12:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,会面时交给你 之前不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the meeting. Not before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.78,1:12:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.24,1:12:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后会有指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instructions will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.68,1:14:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道只要跟着她 你迟早会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew if I followed her, you'd show up eventually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.80,1:14:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.54,1:14:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊尔莎 我不想伤害你的 - 我知道你有你的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ilsa, I never wanted to hurt you. - I know you have your reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.89,1:14:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.95,1:14:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得抽身离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.73,1:14:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.61,1:14:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去巴黎大皇宫不是为了杀拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't at the Palais to kill Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.21,1:14:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.07,1:14:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是去保护他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were there to protect him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.41,1:14:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.76,1:14:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你为了保护我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you killed him to protect me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.73,1:14:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望拉克救出莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted Lark to break Lane out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.75,1:14:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你需要他救出莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you needed him to break Lane out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.82,1:14:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你必须杀了莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you have to kill Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.25,1:14:51.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁强迫你做这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's making you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.82,1:14:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,军情六处\N{\fnArial\fs30}MI6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.11,1:14:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.24,1:15:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在伦敦抓到他后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After we captured him in London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.20,1:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想通过外交途径将莱恩弄回国\N{\fnArial\fs30}they tried to bring Lane home through diplomatic channels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.54,1:15:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但太多国家想要分一杯羹\N{\fnArial\fs30}But too many countries want their pound of flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.27,1:15:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这样的人 见过太多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man like that, what he's seen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.36,1:15:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对英国情报局了解太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he knows about British Intelligence, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.12,1:15:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不能让他将信息泄露给外国政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can't have him talking to a foreign government ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.30,1:15:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我问的不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I'm asking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.08,1:15:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么派你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they send you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.40,1:15:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我证明忠心的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I prove my loyalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.82,1:15:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样我才能真正回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I come home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.29,1:15:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经脱身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.07,1:15:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.45,1:15:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远都不会自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are never free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.02,1:15:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在莱恩身边卧底了两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spent two years undercover with Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.97,1:15:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们来说 我和他一样是个威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}To them, I'm as much of a threat as he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.76,1:15:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么我杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kill him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.64,1:15:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么永远逃亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I never stop running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.42,1:15:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在告诉我他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now tell me where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.62,1:15:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.72,1:15:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样我都会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will get to him one way or another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.26,1:15:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我对付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't make me go through you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.19,1:16:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.20,1:16:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到伦敦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here in London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.94,1:16:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.31,1:16:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好和信使见面了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you ready to meet the courier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.01,1:17:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了 去哪见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Where do I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.44,1:17:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you like to meet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.42,1:17:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,部长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.51,1:17:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾向上帝祈祷这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prayed to God that it wasn't true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.72,1:17:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替他说句话 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in his defense, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.56,1:17:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果伊森没有插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Ethan hadn't intervened, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.17,1:17:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有更多的人被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}a great many people would have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.45,1:17:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 邓恩 我相信巴黎的居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Dunn, I'm sure that the good people of Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.66,1:17:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,和法国全国都会考虑这一点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the nation of France as a whole will take that into account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:17:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.91,1:18:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,至此 我们被告知来伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}At which point, we were told to come to London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.22,1:18:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候进一步指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}and await further instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.81,1:18:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.93,1:18:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.20,1:18:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们二十分钟后和白寡妇见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}we meet the Widow in 20 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.81,1:18:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会带我们去见信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll take us to a courier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.22,1:18:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,信使会用我们丢失的钚核交换所罗门·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}who'll hand over our missing plutonium in exchange for Solomon Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.51,1:18:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者按我们的方案中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, in our scenario, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.37,1:18:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.93,1:18:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.45,1:18:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.55,1:18:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德和我会把你交给信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther and I are gonna take you to the courier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.19,1:18:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克在这里守着真正的莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker stays here and guards the real Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.92,1:18:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.03,1:18:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 为什么非得由我扮莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait. Why do I have to be Lane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.78,1:18:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.56,1:18:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务 我的任务 是把钚核拿回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission, my mission, is to recover that plutonium, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.56,1:18:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I will do so at any cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.80,1:18:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕需要用莱恩做交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I have to trade Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.50,1:18:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The real Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.95,1:18:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will never let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.08,1:19:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等使徒发现你的小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the Apostles realize that you're playing games, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.10,1:19:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会再次失去钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll lose the plutonium. Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.69,1:19:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来操心使徒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let us worry about the Apostles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.59,1:19:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我们有更严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it stands, we have a bigger problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.25,1:19:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,更严重的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bigger problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.35,1:19:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊尔莎 - 伊尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ilsa. - Ilsa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.96,1:19:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的伊尔莎 伊尔莎·浮士德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Ilsa? Ilsa Faust Ilsa?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.52,1:19:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是怎么卷进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she mixed up in all of this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.82,1:19:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她受军情六处的直接命令来杀莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been ordered to kill Lane. Direct from MI6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.14,1:19:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 巴黎那个人是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, wait. So that was her in Paris?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.07,1:19:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 骑摩托的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the bike. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.50,1:19:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 她想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, she tried to kill us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.00,1:19:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不是我们 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, not us. Not us. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.40,1:19:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩 她想杀的是莱恩 她别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane. She tried to kill Lane. She has no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.75,1:19:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she will kill me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.76,1:19:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让那发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let that happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.77,1:19:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你要怎样阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, how exactly are you not gonna let that happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.76,1:19:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.98,1:19:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.05,1:19:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now, we don't have a lot of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.23,1:19:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得开始为会面做准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to start getting ready for this meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.98,1:19:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,会面是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The meeting is a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.76,1:19:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇在和中情局合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The White Widow is working with the CIA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.76,1:19:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has been since the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.23,1:19:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她的军火交易争取豁免权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bargaining for immunity is her stock-in-trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.02,1:19:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一网打尽钚核 使徒和约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Capturing the plutonium, and the Apostles, and John Lark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.04,1:19:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为她在美国人面前挣足了情面\N{\fnArial\fs30}buys her a lot of goodwill with the Americans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.04,1:19:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果斯隆知道会面是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if Sloane knew the meeting was a trap, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.56,1:19:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她为什么不直接告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}why didn't she just tell us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.66,1:19:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为对她来说任何人都可能是约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, in her mind, anybody could be John Lark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.66,1:20:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我们中的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}including one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.55,1:20:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在她的怀疑得到了证实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now her suspicions are confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.08,1:20:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据这份档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to that dossier, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.47,1:20:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一系列的电子证据将亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}a trail of electronic evidence connects Hunt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.28,1:20:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,和疾控中心的天花盗窃联系到了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the theft of smallpox from the CDC.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.32,1:20:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至可以将他和一段长期通信联系在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It also links him to a lengthy correspondence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.88,1:20:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,证实是他招募了德布朗克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}ending with the recruitment of Dr. Delbruuk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.03,1:20:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 再加上 亨特几乎是亲自\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, Hunt handed over the plutonium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.36,1:20:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,将钚核交到了使徒手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the Apostles himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.27,1:20:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些事实 再结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, those facts, coupled with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.17,1:20:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去一系列不服从管控的有罪行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}a long and incriminating history of rogue behavior, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.30,1:20:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,确证了中情局的一个猜想\N{\fnArial\fs30}corroborate a CIA narrative{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.67,1:20:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是亨特叛变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Hunt has snapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.05,1:20:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对拉克的追捕不过是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that his search for Lark is nothing but a cover{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.17,1:20:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了隐瞒拉克其实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hide the fact that Lark…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.27,1:20:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.45,1:20:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不佩服你 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to hand it to you, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.61,1:20:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般当人们说「你是你自己最大的敌人」时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, when people refer to you as your own worst enemy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.06,1:20:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一种比喻\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just a figure of speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.35,1:20:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕斯隆也有问题要问她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Sloane's got some questions for her as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.82,1:20:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,白寡妇免费供出了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Widow offered her up at no extra charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.24,1:21:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯隆从哪得到这些信息的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where did Sloane get this information?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.12,1:21:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.16,1:21:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她允许我带你自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did, however, grant me the opportunity to bring you in, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.90,1:21:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是我终止这项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the condition that I terminate this mission{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.12,1:21:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,并亲自交出所罗门·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hand over Solomon Lane personally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.03,1:21:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 长官 你不能这么做 - 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, you can't do that. - Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.88,1:21:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解莱恩 他绝不想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know Lane. And he has no intention of going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.62,1:21:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要带他回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're taking him back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.17,1:21:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这刚好就是他的目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that's exactly what he wants us to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.36,1:21:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊森 - 长官 你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ethan… - Sir, what do you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.61,1:21:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事 巧合吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}think this is? A coincidence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.63,1:21:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人恰巧发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That someone just happened upon this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.92,1:21:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是莱恩寄给了她 他知道她会做出什么反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane had it sent to her. He knew how she would react.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.49,1:21:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他知道白寡妇会出卖我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like he knew the Widow would turn us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.56,1:21:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.73,1:21:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, sir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.59,1:21:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.40,1:21:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在被他们操控 - 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are being directed. - Hunt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.09,1:21:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 还有两个钚核下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there are still two plutonium cores in the wind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.07,1:21:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你弄丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you lost them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.14,1:21:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 公平点说 是我们弄丢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fairness, sir, we all lost them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.15,1:21:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 长官 你当时不在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully, sir, you weren't there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.16,1:21:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们现在的工作就是为他找借口吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So making excuses for him is your full-time job now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.12,1:21:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 伊森 别让这更艰难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God, Ethan, don't make this any harder than it already is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.38,1:22:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再保护你了 还不明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can no longer protect you, don't you understand that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.43,1:22:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想拿到钚核 只能走到这一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as close as you're ever gonna get to that plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.27,1:22:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你其实并不相信这个说法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you don't actually believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.23,1:22:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信这是个可以保护你或IMF的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe I've been given a choice to protect you or the IMF, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.47,1:22:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要把你带回去交给局里\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why I'm bringing you in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.26,1:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我拒绝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I refuse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.79,1:22:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他是来干嘛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think he's here for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.82,1:22:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他就是个旁观者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's some observer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.48,1:22:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an assassin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.84,1:22:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞卡·斯隆的头号打手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erika Sloane's number-one plumber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.64,1:22:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要敢逃走 他有权追捕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go rogue, he's authorized to hunt you down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.07,1:22:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.85,1:22:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,职责而已 别见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the job. No hard feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.64,1:22:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受事实吧 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accept it, Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.15,1:22:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这局已经输了 木已成舟 别再倔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've lost this one. What's done is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.12,1:22:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 长官 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.93,1:22:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在请求 我是在给你下命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not asking you. I am giving you a direct order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.72,1:22:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,本次任务终止\N{\fnArial\fs30}This mission is terminated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.83,1:22:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即生效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.89,1:22:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯蒂克尔 他是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stickell, he's your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.39,1:22:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,能拜托你好好劝他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please talk some sense into…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.86,1:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官 但你让我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir, but you left me no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.77,1:23:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有十五分钟就要去见白寡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's 15 minutes before we meet the Widow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.67,1:23:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要钚核 只有我们能帮你拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want the plutonium, we're the only ones who can get it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.22,1:23:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你加不加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You in or out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.22,1:23:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}In.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.13,1:23:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.44,1:23:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉得去准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji needs to get ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.74,1:23:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 伊森 - 没时间了 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Ethan… - There's no time, Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.72,1:23:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.31,1:23:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.91,1:23:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.63,1:23:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有种不祥的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}got a bad feeling about this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.69,1:24:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有我们的消息…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't hear from us…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.74,1:24:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会按我的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.09,1:24:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他盯紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take your eyes off him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.52,1:24:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用继续演了 我带你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough games. I'm taking you out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.60,1:24:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Hunt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.40,1:24:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带着你的替身去见白寡妇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone to the meeting, with a copy of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.62,1:24:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.83,1:24:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫使徒 提醒他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the Apostles. Warn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.70,1:25:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么联系他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no way of contacting them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.32,1:25:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,出于我们双方的安全考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For their safety and mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.19,1:25:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有一支撤离小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do have is an extraction team with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.90,1:25:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在进行卫星监视 并提前定好了集合地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}satellite overwatch and a prearranged rendezvous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.28,1:25:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一离开他们就会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll know as soon as we leave the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.66,1:25:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm staying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.16,1:25:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和亨特的事还没了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't finished with Hunt yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.33,1:25:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要把事情搞得这么复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have to make this so fucking complicated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.25,1:25:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.15,1:25:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初的交易很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal was simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.76,1:25:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你陷害亨特 你把钚核给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I help you frame Hunt, you give me the plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.05,1:25:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.06,1:25:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「所有的和平 都需要伟大的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"There cannot be peace without first a great suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.51,1:25:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲越大 和平越久「\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greater the suffering, the greater the peace."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.44,1:25:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我写这些话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I wrote those words, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.56,1:25:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,指的可不是你的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't referring to your peace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.88,1:25:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,或亨特的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Hunt's suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.02,1:25:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧世界的秩序需要被瓦解\N{\fnArial\fs30}The old world order needs dismantling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.35,1:25:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们有可以实现这一点的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have the tools to dismantle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.28,1:25:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你似乎只关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you seem to care about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.99,1:25:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,让亨特背负罪责活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that Hunt lives to take the blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.73,1:25:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这不是无政府主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not anarchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.52,1:25:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.12,1:25:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.12,1:25:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我如愿以偿时\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I have what I want, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.60,1:26:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,使徒会把钚核给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Apostles will give you the plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.17,1:26:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特是你唯一的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt's the only friend you've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.97,1:26:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're only alive today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.86,1:26:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他下不了狠心杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he didn't have the guts to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.87,1:26:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯隆说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sloane was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.08,1:26:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,IMF就是过家家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The IMF is Halloween.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.81,1:26:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过就是几个成年人戴着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but grown men wearing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.31,1:26:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.36,1:26:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,职责而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.96,1:26:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别见怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.49,1:26:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破坏了你的好日子 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've ruined your day, haven't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.24,1:26:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在此之前都伪装得天衣无缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were doing so well up until then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.12,1:26:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这一支才有子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I think this one's loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.41,1:26:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想试试吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.34,1:27:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我演得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how'd I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.57,1:27:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没怀疑过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had a doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.82,1:27:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始明白你们为什么喜欢这么玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm beginning to see why you guys enjoy this so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.47,1:27:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,过奖 部长先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hats off, Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.05,1:27:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙是天生好手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's a natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.72,1:27:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎加入 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the team, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.64,1:27:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这是在犯错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're making a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.86,1:27:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 犯错的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the mistake was mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.24,1:27:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该在巴黎救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I saved your life over Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.44,1:27:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这证明不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This proves nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.87,1:27:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm playing a role, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.97,1:27:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟你们一样 都是为了拿回钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you are, trying to recover that plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.30,1:27:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还是无法解释 你为什么要给斯隆那份档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't explain why you gave Sloane the dossier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.62,1:27:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,试图陷害亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tried to frame Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.07,1:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说得有道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes a good point, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.16,1:28:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.31,1:28:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有妄想症 精神紊乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's paranoid. Delusional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.01,1:28:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如档案里写的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like the dossier says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.69,1:28:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那斯隆是从哪拿到了这份档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where did Sloane get the dossier from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.55,1:28:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.55,1:28:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.69,1:28:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都听到了吧 艾瑞卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get all that, Erika?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.54,1:28:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.19,1:28:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢被利用 沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't appreciate being used, Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.36,1:28:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,闯祸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops. Bad boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.24,1:28:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要把他送到哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where would you like him delivered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.95,1:28:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.29,1:28:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不许动 都不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody move! Nobody move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.58,1:28:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 都放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons down! Drop 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.33,1:28:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 放下武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands in the air! Weapons down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.00,1:28:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it! Drop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.21,1:28:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 快点 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons down! Right now! You!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.94,1:28:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 没事 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's okay. It's all right. It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.15,1:28:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是说好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we had a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.79,1:28:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前是 现在没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did. And now we don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.59,1:28:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的风险太高 我可不敢冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is too much at stake here for me to take any chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.08,1:28:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你们和沃克一起带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bringing you all in, along with Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.04,1:28:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,钚核还流落在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plutonium is still out there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.70,1:28:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却无法放心让你们任何一人去拿回钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't trust a living soul in that room to get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.51,1:29:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在华盛顿弄清楚你们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll sort out who's who in Washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.14,1:29:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞卡 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Erika! - Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.34,1:29:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 我们就照她说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Let's just do what she says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.63,1:29:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的威胁都在这里 都在我们手里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only real threats are in this room, and we have them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.50,1:29:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.81,1:29:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.69,1:29:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩跑哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell is Lane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.86,1:30:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan! Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.24,1:30:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一队都倒下了 派后援来\N{\fnArial\fs30}First team is down. Send backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.66,1:30:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.04,1:30:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 有人受伤 有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. Man down! Man down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.49,1:30:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.05,1:30:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.70,1:31:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我给沃克注射了追踪器 但他跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I tagged Walker, but he's on the run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.26,1:31:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去抓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.50,1:31:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.27,1:31:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.77,1:31:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.74,1:31:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.16,1:31:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.78,1:31:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓回那个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.98,1:32:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊 快啊 快啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.88,1:32:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我定位到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.83,1:32:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.83,1:32:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 班吉 沃克在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Benji. Where's Walker?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.85,1:32:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向右转 他在你西方约四百米处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's about a quarter mile west if you turn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.10,1:32:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右转吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.47,1:32:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.17,1:32:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.20,1:32:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我被盯上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm being followed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.87,1:32:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 被谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? By who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.18,1:32:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么知道 中情局或是使徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know? CIA, Apostles…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.99,1:32:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么区别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference does it make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.22,1:32:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 那就赶紧离开 然后右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, just get out of there and then go right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.24,1:32:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am terribly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.24,1:32:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.51,1:33:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么在绕圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is he running in circles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.08,1:33:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你需要尽快穿过左边的街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you need to cross the street on your left as soon as you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.55,1:33:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你收到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, did you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.79,1:33:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,左边 快左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left, go left, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.01,1:33:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.34,1:34:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在穿过你前方的街道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go across the street right in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.05,1:34:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 他正在远离你 你得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, he's getting away from you! You're gonna have to go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.06,1:34:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要追上他了 直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gaining on him! Go straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.49,1:34:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走 一直走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight? Keep going straight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.64,1:35:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,直走 直走 直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go straight, go straight, straight, straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.95,1:35:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 现在右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now turn right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.66,1:35:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,右\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.66,1:35:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.56,1:35:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 右转 - 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, right! - Are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.45,1:35:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,确定 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.55,1:35:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是左边 左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's left! Turn left!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.85,1:35:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 刚才屏幕旋转被锁定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I had the screen-lock on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.51,1:35:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.26,1:35:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.20,1:35:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.41,1:35:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是要跳窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm jumping out a window!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.28,1:35:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 你要跳…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you're jumping out of a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.28,1:35:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 刚才是平面图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I had it in 2D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.27,1:35:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.77,1:36:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,到桥的尽头左转 你快追上他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of the bridge, turn left. You've almost got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.04,1:36:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 加油 加油 伊森 抓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on. Come on, Ethan, get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.02,1:36:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在他上方不远处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right on top of him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.55,1:36:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 他就在你前方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, he's right in front of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.81,1:36:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他 抓住他 抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him! Get him! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.63,1:37:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能开枪 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:19.60,1:37:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没拿到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until you get your plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.23,1:37:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 他对你还有其他安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. He still has plans for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.56,1:37:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去自首 承认你就是约翰·拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna turn yourself in and admit you're John Lark, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.87,1:37:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在你的小牢房里看着旧世界被毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}then watch the old world implode from your dark little cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.10,1:37:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我不去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.70,1:37:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她的守护天使 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm her guardian angel, Hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.88,1:37:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,再让我看到你 她就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I see you again, she dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:53.79,1:37:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你试图提醒她 她也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try to warn her, she dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.04,1:37:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,该认输的时候就认输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know when you're beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.66,1:39:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是我们从德布朗克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the designs we recovered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.44,1:39:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在柏林的实验室里找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from Dr. Delbruuk's lab in Berlin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.68,1:39:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个五兆吨的核装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a five-megaton nuclear device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.98,1:39:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,比二战中释放的总爆炸能量都要高\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's greater than all the explosive energy released in World War II.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.74,1:39:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要拆除的话 通常得剪断这根引信\N{\fnArial\fs30}To disarm it, normally we'd cut the fuse wire here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.42,1:39:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「通常」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, "normally"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.08,1:39:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克和莱恩有两个钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker and Lane have two plutonium cores, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.30,1:39:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是两个核弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}meaning two bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.62,1:39:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 它们都连接着微波故障保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And they're both linked by a microwave fail-safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.81,1:39:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,精确度在0.1秒内\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is accurate to within one-tenth of a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.91,1:39:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,若试图拆除一枚核弹 会自动引爆另一枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any attempt to defuse one bomb automatically triggers the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.14,1:39:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着核弹一经安装 无法拆除\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning once armed, the bombs cannot be disarmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.50,1:39:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时由一个远程引爆器开启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown is started by a remote detonator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.08,1:39:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,它也有故障保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is also a fail-safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.02,1:39:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味着一旦开始倒计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning once the countdown starts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.99,1:39:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就无法停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.88,1:39:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以解决办法是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the solution to this is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.62,1:39:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.62,1:39:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.18,1:40:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来讲 这就是一次自杀式任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}technically, this is a suicide mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.18,1:40:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.30,1:40:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐吧 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.65,1:40:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识了伊森那么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all the years that I've known Ethan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.08,1:40:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只见过他对两个女人动真情\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's only been serious about two women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.86,1:40:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个是他的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One was his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.48,1:40:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's married?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.84,1:40:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是曾经结过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.32,1:40:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经 她出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was? What happened to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.18,1:40:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群坏人把她抓走了 以此要挟伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she was taken by some people who wanted to get to Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.79,1:40:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 他把她安然无恙地救回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, he got her back in one piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.20,1:40:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就金盆洗手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he quit the game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.67,1:40:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们度过了一段幸福的时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were happy for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.44,1:40:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每次世界上有不幸的事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But every time something bad happened in the world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.40,1:40:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森都会认为：「我该去帮忙的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan would think, "I should've been there."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.13,1:40:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也会自问：「伊森在保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she would wonder, "Who's watching the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.83,1:40:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那谁来保护世界「\N{\fnArial\fs30}while Ethan's watching me?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.31,1:41:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们内心深处都知道 迟早有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep down, they both knew that someday, somehow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.55,1:41:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有不可挽回的惨剧发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}something truly terrible was going to happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.08,1:41:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就因为他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}all because they were together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.37,1:41:12.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.86,1:41:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.36,1:41:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她行踪成谜\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.80,1:41:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很擅长隐藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good at it, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.60,1:41:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我亲自教她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taught her myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.60,1:41:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她偶尔会发送信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every now and then, she sends up a signal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.84,1:41:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让伊森知道她平安无事\N{\fnArial\fs30}to let Ethan know she's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.99,1:41:27.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那能让他安心地继续战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that keeps him going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.03,1:41:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么告诉我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you telling me this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.46,1:41:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身陷现在的困境\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in this mess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.67,1:41:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是因为伊森不愿看着我死\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Ethan wouldn't let me die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.26,1:41:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…He's a good man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.61,1:41:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他或许嘴上不说 但他实际上非常在乎你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he cares about you more than he can admit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.45,1:41:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在无暇分神去为你操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one more worry than he can handle right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.78,1:41:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你也在乎他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care about him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.41,1:41:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should walk away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.33,1:42:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.96,1:42:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,没出什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.82,1:42:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.39,1:42:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.65,1:42:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们如何找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.61,1:42:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,微波收发器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Microwave transponder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.45,1:42:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,能通过卫星追踪到世界上任何一个角落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traceable via satellite anywhere in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.40,1:42:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩后颈上就有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane had one of these in the back of his neck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.33,1:42:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在巴黎时给取出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We removed it in Paris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.81,1:42:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 把我们的收发器装了进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the same time, we put our own transponder in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.08,1:42:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.01,1:42:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十六小时后才激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}36-hour delayed activation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.46,1:42:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防莱恩的使徒扫描他\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case Lane's Apostles scan him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.69,1:42:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们是故意放他走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you planned on letting him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.89,1:42:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是以这种方式 不过是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this way, but yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.41,1:43:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会领着我们找到钚核\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna lead us to the plutonium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.16,1:43:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如何能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.67,1:43:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他陷害我坐牢的计划失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His plan to put me in prison went to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.13,1:43:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他会想让我亲眼看到结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's gonna want me there for the end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.77,1:43:11.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那收发器什么时候激活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when does this transponder activate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.31,1:43:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了 找到他了 找到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him. I got him, I got him, I got him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.88,1:43:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正在欧洲以五百节速度向东移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's traveling east over Europe at 500 knots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.27,1:43:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在飞机上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's airborne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.34,1:43:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要通知中情局吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we inform the CIA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.24,1:43:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局已经被渗透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA's been infiltrated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.76,1:43:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这房间里的人 我不信任任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust anybody outside of this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.74,1:43:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须独立行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to go it alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.32,1:43:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.67,1:43:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况如何 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing, Benji?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.42,1:43:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有拆除这些炸弹的方法 我找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a way to defuse these bombs, I can't find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.36,1:43:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会想到办法的 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll figure it out. I know you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.03,1:43:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 伊森 我们失去信号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. Ethan, we lost the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.74,1:44:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩一定是发现了我们的信号发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane must've found our transmitter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.86,1:44:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最后的已知位置在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his last position?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.06,1:44:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,离这里东北方向30英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At about 30 miles northeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.38,1:44:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里就是他要我们去的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then that's where he wants us to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.40,1:44:09.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那里有什么 - 努布拉河谷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's there? - The Nubra River Valley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.51,1:44:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个范围内只有一个医疗营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only a medical camp there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.24,1:44:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,海外人道主义援助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanitarian Aid Overseas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.00,1:44:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩为什么要袭击一个医疗营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would Lane target a medical camp?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.50,1:44:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,天花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smallpox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.92,1:44:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 天花\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Smallpox.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.42,1:44:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的使徒曾在克什米尔引起天花爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Apostles triggered a smallpox outbreak in Kashmir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.96,1:44:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩把营地安排到那里一定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lane must've wanted that camp there for a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.88,1:44:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但具体是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.72,1:44:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.80,1:44:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.48,1:44:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,努布拉河就在锡亚琴冰川的山脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nubra River is at the base of the Siachen Glacier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.01,1:44:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次核爆炸会使\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a nuclear blast there would irradiate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.54,1:44:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球最大的自然灌溉系统遭受辐射\N{\fnArial\fs30}the largest natural irrigation system in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.25,1:44:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,从中国边境流入印度和巴基斯坦的淡水都会被污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fresh water from the border of China to India and Pakistan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.62,1:44:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要饿死全球三分一的人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna starve one-third of the world's population.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.32,1:44:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,「牺牲越大」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The greater the suffering…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.86,1:44:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,「和平越久」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the greater the peace."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.38,1:44:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.67,1:44:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱恩为什么要把一个医疗营地弄到那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}why Lane wants a medical camp there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.36,1:44:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.77,1:44:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在当务之急是找到拆除炸弹的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that matters now is we find a way to defuse those bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.70,1:45:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I've found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.68,1:45:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.96,1:45:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 炸弹的操作系统似乎有漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, there appears to be a flaw in the bomb's operating system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.65,1:45:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,远程引爆器需要那个引爆键\N{\fnArial\fs30}The remote detonator requires that firing key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.11,1:45:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆除那个键 应该能让保险装置短路\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we remove that key, then it should short out the fail-safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.13,1:45:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就可以剪断引信\N{\fnArial\fs30}and allow us to cut both fuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.13,1:45:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说我们中得有人拿到引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So one of us needs to get the detonator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.01,1:45:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拆除引爆键 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and remove that key. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.47,1:45:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时其他人去把两个炸弹的引信剪断\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the rest of us cut the fuses on both bombs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.38,1:45:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.45,1:45:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.32,1:45:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.60,1:45:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这办法要想奏效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in order to make this work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.95,1:45:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须等到爆炸倒计时开始后\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't remove the key or cut the fuses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.24,1:45:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再拆除引爆键 剪断引信\N{\fnArial\fs30}until after the countdown starts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.57,1:45:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我理清楚一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But wait, just so I've got this clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.35,1:45:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安全拆除炸弹的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only chance to safely defuse both bombs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.04,1:45:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是让爆炸倒计时开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to let the countdown start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.82,1:45:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再拆除引爆键\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then remove that key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.85,1:45:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.82,1:46:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个爆炸装置都已跟引爆器接通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both devices are now connected to the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.28,1:46:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟应该足以让你转移到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen minutes should give you enough time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.45,1:46:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最小安全距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}to reach minimum safe distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.83,1:46:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逃亡的日子结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My running days are over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.96,1:46:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是我的终点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it ends for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.95,1:46:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到处都是信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting signals all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.98,1:46:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在医疗营地里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're at a medical camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.30,1:46:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是X光机 造影扫描仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}X-ray machines, CAT scanners, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.42,1:47:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,和放射性设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}radiological signatures everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.36,1:47:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样仿佛大海捞针\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a needle in a haystack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.58,1:47:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,用排除法 一个一个找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Process of elimination, one at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.54,1:47:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行事 保持联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up. Stay on comms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.10,1:47:18.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.89,1:47:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.93,1:47:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.45,1:47:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.37,1:47:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.63,1:47:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是我丈夫 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my husband, Erik.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.96,1:47:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.84,1:47:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯·索恩 罗伯·索恩医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob. Rob Thorne. Dr. Rob Thorne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.54,1:47:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我曾与茱莉亚… - 在麻省总医院共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I worked with Julia… - At Mass General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.18,1:47:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在去纽约之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.29,1:47:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.68,1:47:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好巧啊 - 就是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What a coincidence! - I know. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.71,1:47:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么会跑到这么偏僻的地方来 - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What brings you all this way? - I was, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.67,1:47:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前在附近的塔图克村\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in Turtuk, not far from here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.80,1:48:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说这里需要人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and heard help was needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.69,1:48:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我们在这里的工作快完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we're just about finished here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.62,1:48:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个村庄都接种疫苗了 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole village is inoculated. But, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.03,1:48:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到塔图克做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you doing out in Turtuk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.22,1:48:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗伯在度假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rob's on vacation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.94,1:48:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我是为工作而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I'm… I'm working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.07,1:48:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们离家很远啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a long way from home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.03,1:48:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 多亏了我们的守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah. Thanks to our guardian angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.06,1:48:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,守护天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guardian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.15,1:48:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这里疫情爆发时 我们正在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah. We were running a field hospital{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.72,1:48:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏丹达尔富尔边界运营战地医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside of Darfur when the outbreak happened here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.28,1:48:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们突然接到一位匿名捐赠人的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here comes this phone call from an anonymous donor, out of the blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.57,1:48:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他要支付整个行动的费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he says he's ready to underwrite the entire operation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:34.40,1:48:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}One condition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.35,1:48:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是由我们来管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}We run the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.48,1:48:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you believe that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.95,1:48:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.69,1:48:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 毫无预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Out of the blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.58,1:48:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫无预兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.51,1:48:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的生活很充实丰富\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's quite a full life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.93,1:48:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 认识茱莉亚之前 我从不出远门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, before Julia, I never traveled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.32,1:48:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连纽约都没离开过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even left New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.02,1:48:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天待在医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never left the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:55.41,1:48:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周工作七天 没日没夜 从不休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven days a week, dusk till dawn. No vacations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.49,1:49:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我好像有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I think I found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.21,1:49:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,照那个速度 我五十岁就能当上外科主任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the fast track to be Chief of Surgery at 50.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.31,1:49:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十五岁就会心脏病发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart attack at 55.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.56,1:49:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是她说服我放下那一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she convinced me to let it all go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.20,1:49:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,到最需要帮助的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help where it's needed most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.00,1:49:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那以后我们一直在外奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we've been on the go ever since, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.28,1:49:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人生从未像现在这般充实满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I've never been more fulfilled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.48,1:49:15.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我替你们高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.18,1:49:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.25,1:49:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we should get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.27,1:49:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多东西要收拾打包\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a lot of packing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.58,1:49:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我去弄就好 你们叙叙旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I'll handle that. You two should catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.64,1:49:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我就不打扰你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, I should get out of your hair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.38,1:49:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑 你应该逗留一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? You should stick around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.66,1:49:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是很遗憾你白跑了一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just sorry you came all this way for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.11,1:49:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如这样吧 我们收拾好行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, we'll pack, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.72,1:49:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后开车送你回图塔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why don't we give you a ride back to Turtuk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.72,1:49:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以在车上叙叙旧 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}you two can catch up in the car? Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.83,1:49:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.08,1:49:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Settled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.48,1:49:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,待会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.29,1:49:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.78,1:49:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 茱莉亚 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry, Julia. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.07,1:50:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,把两架直升机都开走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take both helicopters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.10,1:50:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人都不许离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one else leaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.75,1:50:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, careful, careful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.38,1:50:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸弹已装上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.29,1:50:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但倒计时还未开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the countdown hasn't started yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.96,1:50:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,网络信号很强 说明另一个爆炸装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The network signal's strong, which means the other device{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.80,1:50:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,和引爆器也在附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}is close by and the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.49,1:50:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概在那个方向 离这里半公里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}About half a K in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.15,1:50:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.89,1:50:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 你继续处理爆炸装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, you keep working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.14,1:50:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two, come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.00,1:50:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I got this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.73,1:50:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用担心老路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about old Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.76,1:51:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.96,1:51:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.92,1:51:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 倒计时开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, the countdown has started!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.20,1:51:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只有十五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.59,1:51:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,引爆器在沃克手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walker has the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:52.59,1:51:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.38,1:51:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得疏散这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to evacuate these people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.25,1:51:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.19,1:52:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟后 整个河谷都会被烧成灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole valley's gonna be incinerated in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.37,1:52:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too late!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.76,1:52:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.18,1:52:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拿到引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.75,1:52:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 怎么做 - 我会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? How? - I'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.52,1:52:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到莱恩和另一枚炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Lane! Find the other bomb!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.92,1:52:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他到底在干什么 - 我觉得最好别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell is he doing? - I find it best not to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.81,1:52:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we doing, Luther?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.06,1:52:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是绊线 我只有两只手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tripwires everywhere. I don't have enough hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.15,1:52:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,想办法解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just make it happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.27,1:52:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.20,1:52:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去追引爆器了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone after the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.76,1:53:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 引爆器在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, where's the detonator?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.36,1:53:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:41.26,1:53:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.48,1:53:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不该来的 - 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You shouldn't be here. - Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.00,1:53:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.76,1:53:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我认为的那东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.10,1:53:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 把她弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, get her out of there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.82,1:53:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她能去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she gonna go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.31,1:53:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.75,1:53:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,工具箱里有个红色手柄的钳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the kit, the pliers with the red grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.85,1:53:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.00,1:54:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,管好你自己的事 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind your business, Benji.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.77,1:54:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.08,1:55:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.61,1:55:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.63,1:55:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.80,1:55:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在直升机上追沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a helicopter going after Walker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.61,1:55:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.61,1:55:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么进到直升机里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in the helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.01,1:55:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开直升飞机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you can fly a helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.42,1:55:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才是说直升机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.63,1:55:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑到直升机里搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing in a helicopter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.11,1:56:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我…只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Hey, hey…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:00.33,1:56:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们找到另一枚炸弹没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find the other bomb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.85,1:56:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们还在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still looking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.94,1:56:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过即使找到了也没什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}but finding the bomb is not gonna matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.34,1:56:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非拿到引爆装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless we have the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.64,1:56:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我知道 我保证拿到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. I'll get it. I'll get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.84,1:56:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过 他人在另一架直升机里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, if he's in another helicopter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.54,1:56:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要怎么拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}how are you gonna get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.81,1:56:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想到办法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.95,1:56:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们找到炸弹 我来搞定引爆装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find the bomb, I'll get the detonator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.74,1:56:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会让你们失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.53,1:56:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会让你们失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't let you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.18,1:56:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好 - 你听好 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be ready. - Look, Ethan. Ethan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.76,1:56:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, come in!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.16,1:56:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班吉 班吉 路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji? Benji? Luther?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.31,1:56:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.24,1:56:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能做到 我能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do this. I can do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.00,1:56:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we got here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.96,1:56:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有空速表\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got airspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.12,1:56:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空速表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Airspeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:36.96,1:56:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 动力 这是动力装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, power. This is power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.41,1:56:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}载荷 怎么才能把这个载荷卸掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Payload. How do I get rid of this payload?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.86,1:56:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加大动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.48,1:57:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剥皮钳拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wire strippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:13.88,1:57:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是医生 不是电工\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor, not an electrician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:15.29,1:57:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 拿一下绿手柄的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, the thing with the green grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.86,1:57:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿到了 - 剪我左手这根线\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got it. - The wire in my left hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:19.74,1:57:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 黑线吗 - 左手这根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The black one? - My left hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.59,1:57:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这才是你的左手 - 抱歉 剪另一根\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your left hand. - Sorry, the other wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.15,1:57:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,红线吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.85,1:57:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我右手的红线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the red one in my right hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.70,1:57:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是确认下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just checking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.48,1:57:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:42.85,1:57:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}帮我拿一下 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this for me, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.55,1:57:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:52.80,1:57:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.99,1:57:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}飞到上面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.83,1:58:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错就是我 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, prick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.28,1:58:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.44,1:58:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.75,1:58:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.23,1:58:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太过了 过头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, too much. Too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.86,1:58:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.71,1:58:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉升 拉升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.52,1:58:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接近地面 请拉升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.13,1:58:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请拉升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.10,1:58:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在努力 在努力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying, I'm trying!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.30,1:58:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接近地面 接近地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrain. Terrain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.95,1:59:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 我什么都找不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, I'm not finding anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.36,1:59:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们找错地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're looking in the wrong place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.53,1:59:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signatures everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.83,1:59:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是藏炸弹的完美地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the perfect place to hide it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.29,1:59:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了这样 我了解莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the point. I know Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.75,1:59:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们一直在这里找\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're looking here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.17,1:59:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就正中他的下怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's because he wants us to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.86,1:59:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去村子里找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading to the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.32,1:59:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait for me, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.59,1:59:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 我感觉我找到些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa, I think I've found something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.40,1:59:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这里把线剪断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut this wire right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:41.72,1:59:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,逆时针拧开螺丝 慢慢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that screw counterclockwise, very slowly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.67,1:59:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.90,1:59:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:52.06,1:59:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.20,1:59:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.76,1:59:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是老样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old Ethan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.49,2:00:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.38,2:00:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.78,2:00:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.71,2:00:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 我看到莱恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, I see Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.17,2:00:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.66,2:00:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在村子边缘的一栋房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a house at the edge of the village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.19,2:00:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等着我 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, just wait for me, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.50,2:00:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 等等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa, wait for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.80,2:00:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.01,2:00:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是核弹可怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuclear bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:58.40,2:00:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:42.67,2:01:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 我找到另一枚炸弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, I found the other bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.45,2:01:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:46.63,2:01:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在一间房子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in a house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.66,2:02:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 你在干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.93,2:02:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.47,2:02:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都不知道下面有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's down there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.46,2:02:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拉升 快拉升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull up, pull up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.76,2:02:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个狗娘养的疯子打算撞死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This crazy son of a bitch is trying to ram us!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.63,2:02:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.88,2:02:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.48,2:02:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.78,2:02:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就快拆到引信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost at the fuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.13,2:02:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,得赶紧找到另一枚炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find that other bomb now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.36,2:03:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚是说另一枚炸弹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say "other bomb"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:02.31,2:03:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, do you read me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:03.64,2:03:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.28,2:03:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:25.27,2:03:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.36,2:03:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:28.67,2:03:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing he can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.56,2:03:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等时间一到\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the clock runs out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:31.82,2:03:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森·亨特就会失去一切东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan Hunt will lose everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.96,2:03:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及他在乎的每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone he ever cared about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.75,2:03:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.34,2:03:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:43.60,2:03:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.49,2:03:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊尔莎 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilsa, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:47.53,2:03:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想看到这一幕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.80,2:03:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.30,2:03:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 伊尔莎 - 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ilsa! - Benji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.40,2:03:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 班吉 别过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji! Benji, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.33,2:04:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:51.50,2:04:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.66,2:05:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稳住 稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me. Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.32,2:05:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要 我就快要成功了 坚持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Not when I'm this close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:40.83,2:05:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.31,2:07:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.46,2:07:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他捆起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.10,2:08:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不乖乖地去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why won't you just die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:58.58,2:09:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也帮不上什么忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing else you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:02.28,2:09:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找你的丈夫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go be with your husband.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.45,2:09:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.31,2:09:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.76,2:09:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.33,2:09:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,路德 我们在屋子里 接下来怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Luther, we're inside. Tell us what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.16,2:09:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该能看见连着主板的红线\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see the red wire attached to the motherboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.67,2:09:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.16,2:09:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得把它和旁边的绿线 同时剪断\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to cut that and the green wire next to it simultaneously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.32,2:09:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ready?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.79,2:09:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备 剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.20,2:09:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 那是无法阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. It can't be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.07,2:09:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.84,2:13:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.96,2:13:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,逆时针拧开螺丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn the screw counterclockwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:03.19,2:13:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:05.23,2:13:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,移开表盘 你会看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remove that panel and you'll see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:07.02,2:13:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,电源和引信的地线\N{\fnArial\fs30}the power and ground wires for the fuse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.32,2:13:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.00,2:13:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间一到就剪绿线\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the time comes, cut the green wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.29,2:13:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在别剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not cut it yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.71,2:13:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:20.38,2:13:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 你能听到我说话吗 我们要剪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, if you can hear me, we're ready to make the cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:23.63,2:13:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 请回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:25.32,2:13:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 我们怎么知道他拿没拿到引爆键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji, how do we know if he's got the key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:28.35,2:13:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:29.78,2:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是 我们怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but how do we know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:31.08,2:13:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get it done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:38.41,2:13:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快没时间了 只能希望他拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of time. We just have to hope he has it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:40.57,2:13:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 准备好了 - 剩两秒时剪下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, we're ready. - At two seconds we cut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:42.79,2:13:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 为什么是两秒 不是一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait! Why two? Why not one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.42,2:13:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把时间卡那么紧吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to cut it that close?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:45.60,2:13:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一秒可能会万劫不复 无法弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a second we'll never get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.01,2:13:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底什么时候 能赶快做个决定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When? Can we make a decision on this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:48.43,2:13:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 剩一秒再剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right! We'll do it on one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.69,2:13:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一秒的时候吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutting on one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:50.43,2:13:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 一秒 好了 准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, one. All right, stand by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:54.45,2:13:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:55.96,2:13:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.10,2:13:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:13:57.77,2:13:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.99,2:14:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.43,2:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:37.97,2:15:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.44,2:15:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.94,2:15:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.10,2:15:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,能听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.27,2:15:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't, don't, don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:56.92,2:15:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try to move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:15:58.70,2:16:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 你伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move. You're pretty banged up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:04.02,2:16:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可够走运的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a lucky man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:05.75,2:16:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠机还没死真是奇迹啊 索恩医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a miracle that crash didn't kill you, Dr. Thorne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:08.87,2:16:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友要是再晚一小时找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your friend didn't find you an hour later, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.36,2:16:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会失溫而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would've died of exposure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:11.96,2:16:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我朋友 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My friends? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.44,2:16:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚走不久 她就来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She got here not long after you left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:19.04,2:16:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还搬来了半个印度军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in front of half the Indian Army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.05,2:16:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我们单独待一会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you give us a few minutes, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:26.46,2:16:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, Doc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.97,2:16:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,茱莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.83,2:16:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.66,2:16:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要向我道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason to be sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.45,2:16:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.59,2:16:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:45.45,2:16:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为所有的事 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}for everything. I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.97,2:16:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.30,2:16:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.07,2:16:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看看我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.28,2:17:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我热爱我的事业 如果不是遇到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love what I do, and I never would have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.10,2:17:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远也意识不到这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}found this if I hadn't met you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:02.57,2:17:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有发生过的事 都让我认清我是怎样一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everything that happened, it taught me who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:07.21,2:17:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我明白自身的能力 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It showed me what I am capable of, and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.83,2:17:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.31,2:17:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这里发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what happened here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.30,2:17:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是因为我… - 任何事都没发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it was my… - Nothing happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.42,2:17:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you were here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:23.48,2:17:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每晚我能安然入睡 也是因为知道你一直都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I sleep soundly at night knowing you always will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:36.00,2:17:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你幸福吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're happy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:37.63,2:17:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:42.09,2:17:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了我命中注定的归属\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm exactly where I should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:17:46.78,2:17:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:27.75,2:18:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Per your request, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:30.80,2:18:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将把所罗门·莱恩交给军情六处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm handing Solomon Lane back to MI6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:38.62,2:18:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 要经由中间人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Through a broker, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.21,2:18:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也是我们协议中的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of our ongoing arrangement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:51.13,2:18:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过巴黎的事情之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what happened in Paris, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:53.87,2:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望能保持低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}we prefer to keep a low profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.68,2:19:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你朋友和英国情报机构的旧账也一笔勾销\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that closes your friend's account with British Intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.16,2:19:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,肋骨疼 小心我的肋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ribs. Watch the ribs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:07.86,2:19:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在明白为什么汉利那么信任你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand now why Hunley believed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.91,2:19:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界需要IMF\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world needs the IMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.98,2:19:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need people like you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:17.37,2:19:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对个体性命的在乎程度\N{\fnArial\fs30}who care about the one life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:20.15,2:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和对千百万人性命的在乎程度一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as much as they care about the millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:24.86,2:19:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我就不需要操心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way I never have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:28.99,2:19:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.32,2:19:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在真是前所未有得帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never looked better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.40,2:19:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 别取笑我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.21,2:19:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一刻有多危急\N{\fnArial\fs30}How close were we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.51,2:19:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:45.84,2:19:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平常一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:19:49.07,2:19:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逗我笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't make me laugh.{\r}
